# Forms and Validation

- Validate with Zod schemas
- Use React Hook Form for form state
- Show clear, field-level error messages

# Error Boundaries

- Catch render errors with route `error.tsx` and component error boundaries
- Log to an external service (e.g. Sentry)
- Show a user-friendly fallback; do not blank the whole app

# Security

- Sanitize untrusted input; never `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` with raw user HTML
- Sanitize HTML with DOMPurify when HTML must be rendered
- Use the app’s proper auth flow; do not invent insecure shortcuts
